@startuml ObjectPool_Before_Class

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classBorderColor #666666
skinparam classArrowColor #666666
skinparam classFontSize 11
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam stereotypeCBackgroundColor #AADDFF

skinparam class {
    FontStyle bold
    HeaderBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
}

title **Class Diagram Before Refactoring - Direct Sprite Creation**

class "cocos2d::Sprite" as Sprite {
    + {static} create(filename : string) : Sprite*
    + setPosition(pos : Vec2) : void
    + setScale(scale : float) : void
    + removeFromParent() : void
}

class Map2Scene {
    - _crops : vector<Sprite*>
    - _trees : vector<Sprite*>
    __
    + plantCropAt(location : Vec2) : void
    + harvestCropAt(location : Vec2) : void
    + plantTreeAt(location : Vec2) : void
    + fellTreeAt(location : Vec2) : void
}

Map2Scene --> Sprite : <<create>> every time
Map2Scene --> Sprite : <<destroy>> on harvest

note right of Map2Scene
  Problems:
  - Sprite::create() called every time
  - removeFromParent() destroys object
  - Frequent memory allocation/deallocation
  - Potential memory fragmentation
  - Performance overhead
end note

@enduml
